{
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "**The problem.** Given `n` pairs of parentheses, generate all combinations of **well-formed** (balanced) parentheses."
    },
    {
      "type": "drawing",
      "src": "/drawings/d99c5bfb-27a3-49ea-aeda-9294f76ce3f0.svg",
      "alt": "The decision tree for n = 2. From the empty string, only an opening bracket is allowed. From one open bracket, you can open another or close it. Every branch obeys the two rules, so there are no dead ends: the two leaves, (()) and ()(), are exactly the answers.",
      "width": 611,
      "height": 536,
